"No other member of Gorgon's species is known on Earth."
"Gorgon calls himself the last and least of them; their home lies dead beyond space and time."
"A predecessor accepted the blessing of the Devouring once a successor was chosen."
"Their chosen lived for The Purpose, work like purging infection or correcting imbalance."
"Their ways have disappeared."
"Gorgon refused the Devouring; his work now is revenge."
